ginal hand on this specific board texture (Trip Threes with a Jack kicker). Building the pot is risky as I am dominated by many hands that would continue. Checking is the safest play to maximize expected value by keeping the pot small and avoiding isolation against superior kickers or full houses.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
